WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.042 --> 00:00:01.126
-I'm sorry. I--
-Shut up.

00:00:05.005 --> 00:00:06.798
I don't wanna
lose you again.

00:00:14.181 --> 00:00:15.140
We're going for drinks.

00:00:15.224 --> 00:00:16.391
You can join us if you want,

00:00:16.475 --> 00:00:19.019
but I think you have
better things to do.

00:00:20.020 --> 00:00:21.063
He lives downstairs.

00:00:21.146 --> 00:00:23.190
I don't wanna
to make it complicated.

00:00:23.273 --> 00:00:24.983
Oh, sometimes
the best relationships

00:00:25.067 --> 00:00:26.151
are complicated.

00:00:42.251 --> 00:00:43.460
Did you forget something?

00:00:44.127 --> 00:00:45.128
I did.

00:00:58.392 --> 00:00:59.393
Good night.

00:01:03.188 --> 00:01:05.274
Why shouldn't we stay here,

00:01:05.357 --> 00:01:08.318
where we're free of
the False God's petty tests?

00:01:08.402 --> 00:01:11.238
Together, we can bring
the Truth of the Morningstar

00:01:11.321 --> 00:01:12.322
to the masses.

00:01:12.948 --> 00:01:15.325
And you'll rule beside me,
as my queen.

00:01:17.452 --> 00:01:20.038
I wish I were worthy
of such a station.

00:01:20.122 --> 00:01:21.248
Oh, Lilith.

00:01:21.957 --> 00:01:23.458
Give yourself to me,

00:01:24.209 --> 00:01:26.128
and I will make you worthy.

00:01:56.283 --> 00:01:58.285
Hey! Stop! No!

00:02:16.470 --> 00:02:19.264
Virginia Miller,
you little idiot.

00:02:31.568 --> 00:02:32.986
That was seriously not cool.

00:02:43.539 --> 00:02:44.581
Oh.

00:02:48.252 --> 00:02:49.503
Marcus, let's go.

00:02:52.381 --> 00:02:53.757
I'm really glad
that I decided

00:02:53.841 --> 00:02:55.634
to invest in your business,
David.

00:02:57.219 --> 00:03:00.347
That is a really
lovely thing to say.

00:03:00.430 --> 00:03:01.723
"And I'm so glad
you did, Patrick.

00:03:01.807 --> 00:03:04.476
You really helped to turn it
into the success it is."

00:03:06.228 --> 00:03:07.354
A bold claim.

00:03:27.207 --> 00:03:28.166
Thank you.

00:03:30.836 --> 00:03:31.670
For what?

00:03:32.796 --> 00:03:34.840
I've never done that before

00:03:34.923 --> 00:03:35.924
with a guy.

00:03:40.470 --> 00:03:41.638
Oh, okay.

00:03:41.722 --> 00:03:42.848
Yeah, and…

00:03:44.558 --> 00:03:45.684
I was getting
a little scared

00:03:45.767 --> 00:03:47.394
that I was gonna
let you leave here

00:03:47.477 --> 00:03:49.354
without us having done that,

00:03:49.438 --> 00:03:51.982
so thank you…

00:03:53.192 --> 00:03:54.234
for…

00:03:55.861 --> 00:03:57.446
making that happen for us.

00:03:59.031 --> 00:03:59.907
Stand up.

00:04:00.908 --> 00:04:01.742
Okay.

00:04:01.825 --> 00:04:03.410
Alright,
here's what we're gonna do.

00:04:04.203 --> 00:04:06.121
Get into like a general
fighting position.

00:04:06.205 --> 00:04:07.539
Just, yeah, leg out.

00:04:07.623 --> 00:04:09.374
-Right.
-Kind of in an L. Arm out.

00:04:09.458 --> 00:04:10.959
Here.
Then you want that arm out.

00:04:11.043 --> 00:04:12.544
Yeah, there you go.

00:04:12.628 --> 00:04:13.962
Then you kind of position--

00:04:14.046 --> 00:04:16.423
You wanna put your hands
on my hips?

00:04:17.424 --> 00:04:19.134
No. No, I'm correcting
your stance.

00:04:19.218 --> 00:04:20.552
Look, this move
is really hard.

00:04:20.636 --> 00:04:22.679
If you don't get it
at first, don't feel bad--

00:04:25.641 --> 00:04:27.976
Holy shit, Sam.
That was amazing.

00:04:28.060 --> 00:04:29.311
What do you--

00:04:30.103 --> 00:04:31.480
Sensei Sam.

00:04:35.901 --> 00:04:38.320
You know, this may be the
best date I've ever been on.

00:04:38.403 --> 00:04:40.822
Really? Cause, technically,
this isn't a date.

00:04:40.906 --> 00:04:43.492
Right, not a date.

00:04:52.125 --> 00:04:54.711
And that was not a kiss.

00:04:56.296 --> 00:04:57.214
Yeah.

00:04:59.174 --> 00:05:00.592
That means a lot to me,
Alina.

00:05:04.680 --> 00:05:06.098
You mean a lot.

00:05:09.518 --> 00:05:11.186
To everyone.

00:05:39.923 --> 00:05:42.009
Not many people surprise me,
Miss Starkov.

00:05:53.061 --> 00:05:54.396
Seriously, Poppins…

00:05:55.856 --> 00:05:57.274
how are you still standing?

00:06:00.694 --> 00:06:01.862
I think I'm crazy.

00:06:02.905 --> 00:06:05.157
I think you're surprisingly
sane, considering.

00:06:08.243 --> 00:06:09.244
Look…

00:06:11.455 --> 00:06:12.915
I know what it feels like.

00:06:13.540 --> 00:06:15.417
Feels like
you can't find your--

00:06:21.840 --> 00:06:22.925
Are you sure?

00:06:25.135 --> 00:06:26.136
Yes.

00:06:42.736 --> 00:06:43.779
Okay.

00:07:22.860 --> 00:07:24.319
I just had to check.

00:07:24.862 --> 00:07:26.238
I have a very good
imagination,

00:07:26.321 --> 00:07:31.243
so I just had to be sure
this is real.

00:07:31.326 --> 00:07:32.995
Anne, I have to know,

00:07:33.704 --> 00:07:35.247
do you truly
have feelings for me?

00:07:49.845 --> 00:07:51.096
Really?

00:07:51.180 --> 00:07:52.431
That's it?

00:07:53.307 --> 00:07:56.143
You're just gonna walk away
like this never happened?

00:07:57.352 --> 00:07:59.104
Well, that's what
professionals do, right?

00:07:59.188 --> 00:08:01.648
Sarah, I just had
the best day of my life.

00:08:02.357 --> 00:08:03.901
John B, you're gonna
blow our covers.

00:08:03.984 --> 00:08:06.153
Look, I don't care
about my cover, Sarah.

00:08:06.236 --> 00:08:08.113
I don't care
if my friends find out,

00:08:08.197 --> 00:08:10.282
or your boyfriend
with his frosted tips.

00:08:10.365 --> 00:08:12.659
Look, yesterday, I didn't
even know who you were.

00:08:14.745 --> 00:08:16.079
And today, I'm like…

00:08:18.457 --> 00:08:19.708
Sarah Cameron.

00:08:21.210 --> 00:08:22.753
And honestly,
in my limited experience,

00:08:22.836 --> 00:08:23.670
that's rare.

00:08:23.754 --> 00:08:26.048
That's like…
Like eclipse rare.

00:08:26.131 --> 00:08:27.341
Like a blind person

00:08:27.424 --> 00:08:29.009
seeing colour
for the first time rare,

00:08:29.092 --> 00:08:31.845
or like Bigfoot evidence,
or the northern lights.

00:08:31.929 --> 00:08:34.556
Look, I can't pretend
like this isn't real,

00:08:35.432 --> 00:08:37.142
like this didn't happen.

00:08:37.226 --> 00:08:38.352
-I'm sorry. I--
-Shut up.

00:08:45.943 --> 00:08:47.486
I can't pretend either.

00:08:52.699 --> 00:08:54.451
Hey, man, get a room.

00:09:03.794 --> 00:09:04.711
Did you mean it?

00:09:21.228 --> 00:09:22.312
Did you mean it?

00:09:25.274 --> 00:09:26.441
Of course, I meant it.

00:09:43.333 --> 00:09:45.669
-I can't… I can't do this.
-Okay.

00:09:46.837 --> 00:09:47.880
I understand.

00:09:57.264 --> 00:09:58.223
I don't…

00:09:58.307 --> 00:09:59.725
I don't wanna
lose you again.

00:10:01.643 --> 00:10:03.687
I'm confused.
This is confusing me.

